            "review_title": "Review at I-restaurant",
            "review_text": "Татьяна П\nMinsk, Belarus28 contributions\n0\nEuropean service with Vietnamese smile\nJul 2026 • Couples\nFirst we turned our attention to some great live music... then we went inside, the setting is modest, to become Vietnam. There wasn't even a chance to choose a table, but we did it literally five minutes later. We chose a fish swimming in the aquarium to cook, Chilean Chardonnay. The service was astonishing as good European restaurants. Bring a taste of wine, serving, quick service. If we understand correctly, the dishes were brought by the chefs who prepared them. A smiling waiter, Tuyet Mai, taught her how to eat fish Vietnamese by making rolls... it was delicious, the dishes were big. Not even everyone could eat, took them with them. I recommend it.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten July 23, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
