            "review_title": "Review at I-restaurant",
            "review_text": "Anna Magi\nDubai, United Arab Emirates23 contributions\n0\nAMAZING!\nDec 2025 • Couples\nThis is the restaurant to have a date night. The food was delicious and plenty, the waiters were friendly and honest telling us we ordered too much so we cut some appetizers. We wanted to also try the ice creams but they had a large table that kept the waiters and kitchen busy. Service could be better though our main dishes had more than 40 minutes in between. Luckily we could share everything else and we were well entertained by everything else going on. Try the White House wine carafe. It is delicious! Totally recommend it!\nRead more\nWritten December 22, 2025",
