            "review_title": "Review at I-restaurant",
            "review_text": "Дарья\nIrkutsk, Russia9 contributions\n0\nWe are very pleased! We went to the restaurant twice: for late dinner and lunch. The staff are very hospitable and friendly.\nNov 2025 • Family\nWe came to dinner, ordered, and although it was already off-duty (open until 10:00 p.m.), the receptionist advised that we didn't have to rush, that we could eat safely. The next day, they came for lunch. Both times we were completely satisfied with the quality of the food, the taste and the composition of the dishes. All staff are friendly and kind. The interior is cozy both in the hall and on the terrace, everything is clean. I especially want to note that all dishes are juicy and moderately seasoned with spices, so that the flavor of each ingredient can be felt and enjoyed. Recommend☺️\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten November 1, 2025",
