            "review_text": "Елена П\n1 contribution\n0\nHonest review of a failed dinner.\nOct 2025 • Solo\nI don't recommend this place. The service as such is not available at all. The waiter forgot about the oysters in the order. After a long wait, we had to find out where the order was, and accordingly, any desire to wait anew was gone. It started with no one walking you into the room. You'll be walking between dirty tables and nobody even pays attention to you. After the question, they will, but that's if you persist in your desire to eat here. Next, we had to run for the instruments. The knife is apparently not here for the second course. What a \"cherry on the cake\": for all this you will be charged an additional % in the check for alcohol and a significant % for food. Any café in the natchanga will have a salad service a million times nicer than this restaurant. The mood's pretty messed up.\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten October 4, 2025",
